Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"The Day I Was Born!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:10.52,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\be1\fad(0,0)\c&HC5C9C4&\pos(628,381)\clip(871,117,1072,194)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 970 0 970 355 0 355{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H605853&\fnAnna\fs95\bord0\shad0\fscx102\pos(971,203)}Nobi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's with this big mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Um, well... Nobita-kun was looking for the photo album from when he was a baby, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A photo album? \NWhy did he want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who knows...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I bet everyone will say I look so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:25.70,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka's Growth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:27.16,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Newborn Shizuka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You said we'd all look together, \Nbut you started looking without me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dat's cuz yer so slow, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We thought you skipped out on us because you only had ugly-looking pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Look, Nobita-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.01,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The day Shizuka was born
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is a picture from \Nthe day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know you'd be cute, Shizuka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.98,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fs50\fscy150\fscx120\fn@DoradoHeadline\frx5\move(1478,175,659,185,0,987)\c&H17CCDE&\clip(m 254 96 l 229 337 1079 378 1032 106)}The Story of {\c&H11DD10&}Suneo{\c&H5658D6&\fs35}-chan's {\c&H0DDCE0&\fs50}Birth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:53.81,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Story of Suneo-chan's Birth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:59.90,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,{\pos(664.714,358.857)\clip(m 91 53 l 56 408 94 412 120 434 129 457 131 493 124 513 106 547 72 573 37 593 32 654 1273 660 1274 624 1240 594 1219 552 1208 516 1210 489 1229 459 1259 456 1189 53)}{\q2\alpha&HFF&\blur20\fs270\t(0,250,\alpha&H00&\blur0\fs110)\fscy150\fscx120\fn@DoradoHeadline\frx2\c&H11DD10&}Suneo{\c&H5658D6&\fs55}-chan {\c&H0DDCE0&\fs110}Was Born
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:57.23,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be1}At 5:05 PM...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:00:59.73,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Suneo-chan was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:03.99,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Holding him in my arms \Nis like holding a real-life angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:06.28,Electronic Voice,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, my baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, my Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:09.82,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Records of Takeshi #1
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dis here is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\be1}Now, dun be shocked 'bout \Nma' {\i1}insane{\i0} amount'a cuteness!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Takka look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:17.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}6/15: The day Takeshi was born
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's shocking, all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That looks just like a gorilla...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm next. Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:29.76,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\be1\fad(0,0)\c&HD4D4D4&\pos(672,660)\clip(346,547,987,658)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 970 0 970 355 0 355{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H000000&\fsp-3\fnAnna\fs75\bord0\shad0\fscx102\pos(667,610)}One month after
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H000000&\fsp-3\fnAnna\fs75\bord0\shad0\fscx102\pos(667,665)}Nobi-chan was born
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aren't I pretty cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wut parta {\i1}dat {\i0}is cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.26,0:01:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I knew you'd have \Na stupid-looking face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.68,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\be1\fad(0,0)\c&HD4D4D4&\t(\fscx135\fscy145)\move(644,643,644,563)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 820 0 820 125 0 125{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:33.93,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\c&HD4D4D4&\fscx135\fscy145)\pos(644,563)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 820 0 820 125 0 125{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H000000&\fsp-3\fnAnna\fs85\bord0\shad0\move(667,580,667,495)\t(\fscx145\fscy145)}One month after
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H000000&\fsp-3\fnAnna\fs85\bord0\shad0\fscx102\move(667,650,667,595)\t(\fscx145\fscy145)}Nobi-chan was born
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H000000&\fsp-3\fnAnna\fs85\bord0\shad0\pos(667,495)\fscx145\fscy145}One month after
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H000000&\fsp-3\fnAnna\fs85\bord0\shad0\fscx102\pos(667,595)\fscx145\fscy145}Nobi-chan was born
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You think so...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:38.01,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}One month after Nobi-chan was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:39.27,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(500,500)}33 days after he was born
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:40.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(500,0)}34 days after he was born
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, Nobita-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.43,0:01:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where's the picture \Nfrom the day you were born?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yoink!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why does this album...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Start one month \N{\i1}after {\i0} you were born?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.61,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yea! 'Cuz everywun \Nstarts da day their kid's born!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Maybe they {\i1}really didn't {\i0} want to keep any \Npictures of you from right after you were born?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:08.25,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Nobi" means "stretch".
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I mean, your name's \N"Nobi Nobita", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They wouldn't have given you such a weird name unless you had a really long, stretched out, stupid-looking face!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.41,0:02:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nice wun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They must have some reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wut kinda reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Maybe his stupid face \Nwas so ugly, it broke the camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.71,0:02:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What do you mean by that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Fine, I'm going to look for the \Npicture from the day I was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And don't be surprised \Nthat I'm {\i1}SO {\i0}cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So... {\alpha&HFF}cute...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So... cute...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, they just \Nsay anything they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But why are there no \Npictures for a whole month?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Welcome back, Nobi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I see you went out to play \Nwithout doing your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's more, you \Nleft it extremely messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I-I was looking for a picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, where's the picture \Nfrom the day I was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That is NOT what we \Nare discussing right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You have school tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wasn't it just the other day that you forgot your homework, and had the teacher scold you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So go do it \N{\i1}this instant{\i0}, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But I said I'd do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You always say that, and then \Ndon't do it until the very last minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ugh... I said I'd do it, so I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I sure wish you'd trust me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then if I leave you be, \Nyou'll do it on your own, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.69,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then first, I'll go look for \Nthat and go to the vacant lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\t(\fs70)\fad(0,500)}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What in the world \Nare you thinking, Nobita?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All you ever is give me lip service \Nwith your "I'll study, I'll study."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Your mother is absolutely right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}How about keeping at \Nleast {\i1}ONE {\i0}promise you make?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Honestly, how did you \Nturn into a boy like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I don't remember \Ngiving birth to a child like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What do you mean, "what"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who on earth did you take after?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Go think about what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are you doing, Nobita-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm running away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\i1}WHAT?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I finally figured \Nout the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's because I'm \Nnot their real kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.31,0:04:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What kind of nonsense \Nare you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But that's the \Nonly thing I can think of!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If I was their real kid, they wouldn't get \Nmad at me like that or say such awful things!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And I know they would have taken loads of pictures of me the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There's no pictures until \Na whole month after I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Not a single one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.41,0:04:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Y-Yeah...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}My parents wouldn't have \Ngiven me a name like "Nobita"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They would have given \Nme a way cooler name!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well now that you mention it, \Nyour name {\i1}is {\i0}quite unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.47,0:04:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But isn't "Nobi Nobita" easy to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You could say it's pleasing to the ear, and it doesn't have any particularly deep meaning to it. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It doesn't mean anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You mean they \Njust randomly picked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I knew it! \NI'm not their real kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah, no! That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is where we part, Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But where should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gian's place...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.12,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\be3}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.71,0:05:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Suneo's place...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.13,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\be3}You're such a loser, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka-chan's place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There's Shizuka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sorry I made you wait. \NCome on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.47,0:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, Mom. Could you tell me \Nabout the time I was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's see... The weather was great that day, \Nand it was a nice, quiet morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But you were a very lively little bundle of joy, \Nand started crying really loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was really surprised at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But I was so happy just to \Nhear that loud voice of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It looks like it's about to rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We better get home \Nbefore we're drenched!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw... It started raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What am I gonna do? \NI forgot to bring an umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mommy, let's hurry home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:27.96,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Neapolitan: Japanese-style spaghetti that is cooked until it's slightly softer than al-dente, then tossed in a mixture of ketchup, sausages, and various vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What should we have for lunch? Neapolitan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah! I love Neapolitan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I love Neapolitan, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, you... \NWhere did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.27,0:06:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are you all by yourself, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:03.54,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\be3\i1}I'm{\i0} all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, he's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow, looks like it's \Nreally coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}D-Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun, stop being \Nstubborn, and come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mom said we're \Nhaving Neapolitan for lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No! I'm never going back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Because I already \Ndecided I won't go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm going to go look \Nfor my {\i1}real {\i0}mom and dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What is this nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I mean, just look at you... {\alpha&HFF&}and your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I mean, just look at you... and your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There's no parent and child \Nwho look more alike than you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If that were true...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}She would have been worried about me and come to look for me right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, where might my \Nreal mother and father be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then, do you wanna go check?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go back to the day you \Nwere born with the Time Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's right! \NWe had that the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Let's go to the year \Nand day I was born, August 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is my room, ten years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gah! It's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This isn't my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Maybe you really \Naren't their real kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, sorry, sorry! \NWhat I meant to say was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's because you \Nhaven't been born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, so that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This must have \Nbeen your dad's den.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait, no one's here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Even though this is \Nthe day I'm born, and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.50,0:08:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? \NW-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's so mean, how \Ncould you forget your own kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, more importantly...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun, \Nyou can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You haven't been born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, Baby...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Tamako-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I heard my baby was born, so I took off work early, and hurried right home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, this is Nobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, this is the nurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The baby's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\i1}WHAT?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's about to be born?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Got it! I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He must be headed to the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? Where'd Dad go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, can I see that one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dad's buying a camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And this is the day \NNobita-kun was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So why isn't there \Neven a single picture of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Snap, snap! Snap, snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sna... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Um, my child is about to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, and this is my first child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But you need to \Nbe quiet in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's born...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's born!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi-san, congratulations! It's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Uh, no... \NI-I mean, thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Go on, go in and see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:39.77,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi Tamako
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is it, Mom's hospital room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know it must \Nhave been hard, {\i1}Mom{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Thank you for giving it your all through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The baby is the one \Nwho had to give it his all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I have to take a picture of you \Nafter you were just born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Look! He just laughed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.75,0:13:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let us see! Let us see!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah! Oh! Hey, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?! {\i1}THIS {\i0} is me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm so wrinkled up, \NI almost look like a monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who are you calling a monkey?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who were those kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They've been hanging \Naround me for a while, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'd really like to meet the parents \Nwho taught them such bad manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.27,0:13:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, that was a surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's what babies look \Nlike when they're just born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But it's really sad, because I looked like one of those {\i1}haniwa{\i0} clay figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:33.03,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Haniwa clay figure: Hollow clay figures made in the 3rd to 6th centuries AD, and used as a funeral ritual. \NIn modern days, they are appreciated as a form of ancient art.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, yeah... Did you \Nalready let Grandma know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.53,0:13:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes. She said she had to go \Nreport this to our ancestors right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}She was crying for joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Her face just \Nlit up with happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So what should we \Nname our little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I've already thought \Nabout that, long and hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Isn't it a nice name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.59,0:14:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want them to \Ngive me a cooler name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know! I'll let them \Nknow what I want to be called!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, cut it out! \NYou'll just get yelled at again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? A meaning to the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Of course there's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There, you can see it \Nperfectly from here, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That large cherry blossom tree \Nstanding along the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I do. What about that tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Actually, on the day you told me \Nwe were going to have a baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I came to a place \Nclose to here for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And that's when I found that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It was still cold at the time, so the tree was \Ncompletely bare except for a few dead leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But strangely, there was something about it that attracted me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wondered what kind of flowers would blossom on it before the child in your tummy would be born...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And actually came to see \Nthat tree countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So that's why you said \Nyou decided on this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want our child to grow up to \Nbe strong and healthy like that tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want him to grow up to be carefree, excel, and reach new heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The name "Nobita" \Nencompasses those wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:13.07,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Nobi-nobi" means "to be carefree", and "ta" means "grand" or "magnificent".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a wonderful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want him to grow up to be a \Nstraightforward, honest, kind boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's a given!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And if he takes after you, there's no doubt he'll have excellent grades!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.45,0:15:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And if he takes after you, he'll be a great sportsman with amazing athletic skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Or maybe he'll be \Ngood at drawing like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And he'll become \Na really amazing artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It looks like you got all \Nof your parents' bad traits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Maybe Nobita will become \Na scholar, or a politician?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Anything's fine, if he becomes \Nan outstanding member of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want him to be \N compassionate, brave...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Cheerful, manly, strong, \Npure, upright, handsome...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:16:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And above all, a boy \Nwho is kind and easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Putting all those expectations \Non him kind of puts me in a bind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He's not really {\i1}that {\i0}great of a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What kind of grudge do \Nyou have against our child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.16,0:16:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Look, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, I know! \NLet's take some pictures!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He said pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.30,0:16:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right, I'll take a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And then tell future Nobita \Nall about the time he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.76,0:16:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! Let's come back here \Nwhen the cherry blossoms bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder if he'll call me \N"Dad" around that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll go take a picture of that \Ncherry blossom tree, too! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sure is a fine tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder if Nobita \Nwill be happy with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where is it? \NWhere is it? Where'd it go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's dangerous, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let me go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I said it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where's Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dad! Dad...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon, save Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Calm down, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Um, uh, let's see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The camera I bought with every last bit of money I struggled to save over the past three years...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now it's ruined...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a real shame. We won't have any pictures of Nobita when he was just born...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go home, Nobita-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You understand \Neverything now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You were loved from the \Nmoment you were born, Nobita-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And you were \Ntheir precious treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's that cherry blossom tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's so big and tall! \NAnd it's really beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}After all, this tree is \Nyour namesake, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:19:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi-chan!\NNobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mom, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.51,0:19:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm sorry, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}To tell you the truth, I was just \Nso ecstatic the day you were born...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That I accidentally broke \Nthe camera I had saved up to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But I had wanted to let \Nyou see them no matter what...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Pictures of you when \Nyou were just born, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mom had to go through \Na lot to give birth to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But you had to go \Nthrough a lot to be born, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You struggled and struggled, \Nand put all your effort into being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And I wanted to explain that to you someday, \Nwhile showing you your newborn baby pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But your Mom and Dad will never forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The moment that you came into this world, \Nafter going through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi-chan, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sketches of you, Nobi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.69,0:20:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? Of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Your Dad stayed up all night drawing these the day you were born, Nobi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Even though he did his absolute best to remember the first time he saw you while drawing these, Nobi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He said they weren't very good, \Nand had them hiding away all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:29.04,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\be1\fad(0,0)\c&H94BEDC&\move(675,411,675,1011)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 970 0 970 305 0 305{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H000000&\fnArchitext\fs145\bord0\shad0\fscx102\i1\move(675,411,675,1011)\frz2.588\frx4\fry0}8/7  The day Nobita was born{\fnAnna\i1}!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:47.06,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\be1\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\fad(0,0)\c&H94BEDC&\t(\fscx120\fscy120)\move(268,421,220,434,25,2486)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 200 0 200{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0\c&H131D22&\fnArchitext\fs80\bord0\shad0\fscx102\i1\frx2\fry2\frz25.46\t(\fs85)\move(327,397,302,414,25,2945)}Together with\N Mommy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:21:00.86,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)\be1\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\c&H8BB5D3&\pos(257,488)\clip(m 405 78 l 356 179 353 221 363 232 339 242 324 246 316 284 300 311 304 332 308 343 295 362 297 370 329 363 341 331 350 333 349 361 373 361 382 319 401 316 428 339 440 436 189 479 197 348 167 145)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 350 0 350 400 0 400{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:21:00.86,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)\be1\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\fad(0,0)\c&H8BB5D3&\pos(1009,524)\clip(m 832 103 l 825 157 852 178 836 210 848 223 890 237 938 292 960 327 936 371 942 462 1107 518 1239 411 1202 226)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 350 0 350 400 0 400{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)\q0\c&H131D22&\fnArchitext\fs95\bord0\shad0\i1\frx2\fry2\frz7.142\pos(287,500)}Your name is\N\N\N{\fs150}Nobi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1500)\q0\c&H131D22&\fnArchitext\fs165\bord0\shad0\fscx102\i1\frx2\fry2\pos(1020,468)\frz358.3}Nobita{\fnAnna\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:34.63,Insertromaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs38\be1}ayatori mitai ni zenbu umaku ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:34.63,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}あやとりみたいに　ぜんぶうまくいかない
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:34.63,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}Just like making string figures, \Nnot everything in life will go well for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.79,0:20:44.09,Insertromaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs38\be1}chanto watasezu ni kongaragattari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.79,0:20:44.09,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}ちゃんとわたせずに　こんがらがったり
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.79,0:20:44.09,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}You might not come across right, \Nand make things more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:49.52,Insertromaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs38\be1}boku wa nigate ya shippai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:49.52,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}ボクは　にがてや　しっぱい
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:49.52,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}I've made mistakes, \Nhave things I'm not good at....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:53.48,Insertromaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs38\be1}yarusenai kimochi sono mono
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:53.48,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}やるせないきもち　そのもの
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:53.48,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}And sometimes feel \Nhelpless and depressed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:21:05.95,Insertromaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs38\be1}kitto daremo ga motteru okubyou na kimochi sono mono
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:21:05.95,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}きっとだれもが　もってる　おくびょうなきもち　そのもの
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:21:05.95,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}But I'm sure everyone has \Nfelt afraid like that at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:16.20,Insertromaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs38\be1}kimi no naka no Nobita ima wa doushite imasu ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:16.20,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}キミのなかの　のび太　いまはどうしていますか？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:16.20,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}Why is the Nobita in you there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.62,0:21:25.80,Insertromaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs38\be1}kokoro no katasumi de naite imasu ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.62,0:21:25.80,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}こころのかたすみで　ないていますいか？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.62,0:21:25.80,Inserttl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fs35\be1}Is it because you're crying within \Nthe nooks and crannys of your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I love them, Dad! \NI'll treasure your drawings forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm bad at studying, \Nand I'm no good at sports, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm not straightforward, not always honest, and I'm always making excuses...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't be silly! You just need \Nto do your best from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's right. You might be a \Nlittle {\i1}too{\i0} easygoing and carefree...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But we're both so \Nhappy we have you, Nobi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:21:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's grown so much \Nin the ten years since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.79,0:22:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just like Nobi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.25,0:22:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}How about we get a nice \Npicture of everyone together?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's fine, but don't we need a camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, I'm taking it. Say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.80,0:22:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Cheese!
